---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Community
permalink: /community/
description: "TOSS Charitable Trust, the youth-led organisation Inigo Papu Vinodhan founded in 2009: Talent Fest, Operation Oxygen, Clean Cauvery, libraries and more."
image: /assets/community/talent-fest-2025-group.webp
---
<div class="wrap community-page">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Community · {{ community.expanded }}</p>
    <h1>{{ community.name }}</h1>
    <p class="lead">{{ community.intro }}</p>
    <p class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="{{ community.involveUrl }}" rel="noopener">Volunteer or donate ↗</a>
      <a class="button ghost" href="{{ community.url }}" rel="noopener">Visit tosstheworld.org ↗</a>
    </p>
  </header>

  <figure class="wide-photo"><img src="{{ community.photos.group.src }}" alt="{{ community.photos.group.alt }}" width="{{ community.photos.group.w }}" height="{{ community.photos.group.h }}" fetchpriority="high"></figure>

  <ul class="big-stats big-stats-row">
    {% for s in community.stats %}<li><span class="big-num">{{ s.value }}</span><span>{{ s.label }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <section class="campaigns">
    <h2>What TOSS runs</h2>
    <ul class="campaign-grid">
      {% for c in community.campaigns %}
        <li class="card">
          <p class="card-meta"><span class="tag">{{ c.area }}</span></p>
          <h3>{{ c.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ c.text }}</p>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="photo-pair" aria-label="Photographs">
    <figure><img src="{{ community.photos.thanks.src }}" alt="{{ community.photos.thanks.alt }}" width="{{ community.photos.thanks.w }}" height="{{ community.photos.thanks.h }}" loading="lazy"></figure>
    <figure><img src="{{ community.photos.trees.src }}" alt="{{ community.photos.trees.alt }}" width="{{ community.photos.trees.w }}" height="{{ community.photos.trees.h }}" loading="lazy"></figure>
  </section>

</div>

<section class="rail-section years-band" aria-labelledby="rail-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="years-head reveal">
      <p class="years-num" aria-hidden="true">17</p>
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Since 19 March 2009</p>
        <h2 id="rail-title" class="rail-title">Seventeen years, from a youth club to a trust</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ol class="rail">
      {% for m in community.milestones %}
        <li class="rail-item">
          <span class="rail-year">{{ m.year }}</span>
          <p>{{ m.text }}</p>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap page community-page community-rest">

  <section class="cv-section">
    <h2>In the news</h2>
    <div>
      <ul class="entry-list">
        {% for c in coverage.items | limit(4) %}
          <li>
            <time datetime="{{ c.date }}">{{ c.outlet }} · {{ c.when }}</time>
            <a href="{{ c.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ c.headline }}</a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="after-list"><a class="more" href="/press/">All reports →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cv-section">
    <h2>In my teaching and research</h2>
    <div class="cv-text">
      <p>{{ community.college }}</p>
      <p>The trust's street libraries and renovated school libraries are the subject of a paper I co-wrote for the G20 Library Summit at Pondicherry University in 2024 (see my <a href="/cv/#publications">publications</a>), and what TOSS has learned about running a volunteer organisation comes into my classes on management and entrepreneurship.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
